Z||000003||fierospeeder||10-09-2001||01:10 AM||||I was watching this on the news when it happened.  I didn't hear any sonic booms.<P><BR>I use to be in Civil air patrol and wanted to be a pilot in the AF, but i dont have 20/20 vision.  Sucks.   But i have had rides on kc135 and seen F-16s ride and get fueled up in the air.  And soloed in a cessna.<P><BR>Anyway, this was on fox, and they had a guy call up from the plane with a cell, just saying it was a mentally challenged person, yada yada....    <P>2nd phone call, is from a lady that heard the sonic booms someplace in the suburbs.  She pissed me off, it might be just me.  <P>"my kids were playing outside, and heard a loud noise, like two explosions.  They ran inside, and i heard it too.  I was frightened.  We ran downstairs to the basement and stayed there.  I called 911 and the line was busy.  I tried turning on the TV and there was nothing on.  (part that pisses me off)  I think we are all uneducated.  I didn't know what was going, and (crying) there was nothing on tv to tell me what was happening and 911 was no help.  Its sad that we are uneducated.  (she repeats that comment.)    <P>Not her exact words, but close.<P>perspective<BR>walter jacobson<P>i mean fierospeeder<BR>||||reg||1
