Z||000010||falconhulk||10-09-2001||01:48 PM||||What are you talking about?  I dont know anyone who is scared!  People worry about thier family.  Dont confuse concern with fear.  Our country, our mothers, our children were threatened on TV internationally.  Osama said we will never be safe.  But who is hiding?  Who is really scared?  We are pissed not scared.  Any further action that causes further reaction from us will teach him the "wrath of god".  Make no mistake he is in Afganastan not becasue he enjoys the local beach! he is there becasue that country is a fortress protected by some of the most mentaly tough individuals on the face of this earth.  He is hiding where he thinks he is safe.  He figured we would never try to invade.  We would just fire some rockets and kill some civilians so he could call a jihad and get all the Arab states to unite.  For the first time in many many years this is a truly just cause for the USA.  This was an attack on OUR families not some far off land that we dont care about.  We have justice and moral strength on our side.  Yes there will be jihad.......but we have declared it first and our wrath WILL be holy.||||reg||1
