Z||000013||87GTBro||10-09-2001||10:23 PM||||I have actually heard a sonic boom before.  It is one of the neatest things you will ever experience.  Well, it just sounds like an explosion and shakes the ground, but it is amazing that it could come from a plane flying over head.<P>I was near Houston when it happened.  Out in the middle of nowhere.  The pilot should not have broken the sound barrier (illegal over the continental U.S.) so I don't know why he did it.  I knew it was a sonic boom because I ran outside and saw the plane flying off in the distance.  I didn't get to see what kind of plane it was, but I DO know what a sonic boom sounds like and I can see how people mistook them for explosions.<P>---edited for grammar---<BR>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87GTBrosig_3.gif">   <BR>AOL IM: GTFiero86Dan<BR>'86 GT 4 speed<BR>'87 GT Auto<p>[This message has been edited by 87GTBro (edited 10-09-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000014||Fierowrecker||10-09-2001||11:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 87GTBro:<BR><B>I have actually heard a sonic boom before.  It is one of the neatest things you will ever experience.  Well, it just sounds like an explosion and shakes the ground, but it is amazing that it could come from a plane flying over head.<P>I was near Houston when it happened.  Out in the middle of nowhere.  The pilot should not have broken the sound barrier (illegal over the continental U.S.) so I don't know why he did it.  I knew it was a sonic boom because I ran outside and saw the plane flying off in the distance.  I didn't get to see what kind of plane it was, but I DO know what a sonic boom sounds like and I can see how people mistook them for explosions.<P>---edited for grammar---</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey Bro!<BR>When I was around 8 to 10 years old, I remember seeing aircraft go over silently, but very fast, just over 300 feet off the ground...<BR>The first thing you did is cover your ears!!!<BR>The concussion would be felt throughout your body...<BR>Got to be a little old after a while...<BR>crash...||||reg||1
